# Thunderhead Array (CIPlay thunderhead_array): the plan The Rainmakers' sixth island, quest "Storm Grid"
# The plateau (14 m) round 0 8 r 30: the rod grid x -21..21 z 2..26; the connectors at x -24.5 (z 8/14/20), the grid
# board at -24.5 0; the generator hall x -12..-6 z 30..34.5, the bunker x 4..10, Ingrid's cage at -1 32; the landing at
# 0 -55, the path up the south side, the zipline from 14 -16 down to the beach at 22 -54.
island Thunderhead Array
offset 0 24
expect step 0
expect title Storm Grid
wait 5
expect hidden storm
zone landing
expect step 1
read Array safety rules
expect step 2
zone plateau
expect shown storm
expect step 3
use wire1
expect message all three generators first
use gen1
use gen2
use gen1
expect message running
use gen3
expect story power 3
expect step 4
use gridboard
expect message aren't wired
use wire1
use wire2
use wire3
expect story link 3
use gridboard
expect shown gridnote
read Grid restored
expect step 5
wait 2
kill Screecher
expect step 6
use bunkerdoor
expect shown bunkerdoor
open Bunker lockers
expect message keycard door
open Generator hall chest
use bunkerdoor
expect hidden bunkerdoor
zone bunker
expect step 7
open Bunker lockers
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect story cagekey 1
expect step 12
read Array engineer's diary
expect step 13
open Ingrid's tool bag
expect message won't let go
use ingridcage
expect survivor rainmakers_ingrid
open Ingrid's tool bag
expect item ZiplineTool 1
expect step 14
# RAIN 10-26: the hub, Signe Lund, the climb, Basalt Cave, the secrets
expect hidden ta_rewchest
use ta_machine
expect hidden ta_rewchest
read Linesman's notice
expect step 15
use Signe Lund
wait 1
expect step 16
expect hidden ta_lampchest
use Line lamp 1
wait 1
expect shown ta_lampchest
open Signe's tool roll
zone ta_hill
expect step 17
open Storm watch mast deck box
wait 3
expect story ta_top 1
expect step 18
zone ta_cave
expect step 19
open Basalt Cave chest
wait 3
expect story ta_cave 1
expect step 20
use ta_machine
expect shown ta_rewchest
expect story ta_fixed 1
open Earthing switch reward
wait 3
read Earthing log
expect step 21
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the set
zone ta_plane
open Weather plane's crate
read Weather pilot's note
zone ta_jumps
open Basalt perch
open Stack top
expect hidden ta_setchest
use ta_piece1
use ta_piece2
use ta_piece3
use ta_piece4
use ta_piece5
wait 2
